  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLIMATE PROMISE UNDP-KEN-00132664</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate promise 2 is supporting Kenya accelerate implementation of its updated NDC. Specifically it seeks to support Government of Kenya to implement strategic actions in the forestry and land sector, which is a priority sector if it NDC. These actions include enhancing transperency, mobilizing of climate finance and enhancing participation of community groups in forest and landscape restoration.</narrative>
  </description>
